        "created_at": "2018-11-20T08:05:28.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I will be blunt I have not recieved the OblivAeon Kickstarter goods and I know this is not the place for this.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I live in Australia which means I often have to wait for products to get to me, however over a month and a half is a difficult amount of time to accept. I filled out the form on Google Docs about two weeks ago, so I am chasing the problem through a different avenue.</p>\n<p>Some people I know have their copies and at least one other has not, I would like to find out about what is happening.</p>\n<p>Trevor H Smith</p>\n<p>Backer number 6,796</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:52:12.548Z",
