        "raw": "<p>I will be blunt I have not recieved the OblivAeon Kickstarter goods and I know this is not the place for this.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I live in Australia which means I often have to wait for products to get to me, however over a month and a half is a difficult amount of time to accept. I filled out the form on Google Docs about two weeks ago, so I am chasing the problem through a different avenue.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Some people I know have their copies and at least one other has not, I would like to find out about what is happening.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Trevor H Smith</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Backer number 6,796</p>",
