        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Hi Vigognagator, Did you receive any further update from this. I am in a similar position and filled the form out nearly a month ago (multiple times) and have still not had any response to give me any reassurance that anything is happening. Like you I have been turning to any contact form I can get to to try to find out if anything is happening? I have tried emailing through the base contact email as well but It just feels like nothing is happening and the weeks are just going to tick by?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It seem like there was an issue with the Australian shipment that we have not been able to get any update on.....</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Paul, would be great to know if you are still an option to follow up with? It would be great to be able to just play these games again without the sour taste of frustration that I currently have whenever I see the game on my shelf and the $240 I spent over two years ago...</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Still in hope.......</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Scott</p>",
